#AREA Centaur Grove~
#AUTHORS Jaxom~
#RANGES 5 35 1 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NOCASTLE|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT
#RESETMSG The clatter of centaur hooves rings through the grove.~


#HELPS
-1 'CENTAUR GROVE' CENTAURHQ~
{120}Centaur Grove
-------------

The Centaur Grove is where all centaur come to meet and plan their moves
in the neverending racial wars.  Given the fact that most centaurs come
to this grove well armed and prepared for war, it is suprisingly peaceful.

This grove was created on April 8, 1999 by

(a) {170}Jaxom{300}

{a}JAXOM
~
96 CENTAURHQVNUM~
The vnum for joining centaur hq is 13523.  At the centaur leader.
~
0$~


#MOBILES
#13500
centaurgrove~
a centaur~
A centaur eyes you suspiciously.~
He stands over eight feet tall and is powerfully muscled.  His equine lower
section merges smoothly with his human torso making this mixed breed
seem very natural.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
30 0 BODY_FOOT 1d1+479 1d1+21
50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#13501
target~
a target~
A target is carved in the tree here.~
It is made up of concentric rings carved into the tree.  A small sign
hangs nearby saying to ask the leader to reset the range for you.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
95 0 0 1d1+8000 1d1+80
1000 RACE_GNOME
POS_SLEEPING POS_SLEEPING SEX_NEUTRAL
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) > 0
  if quest(0, 3, $n) < 5
    mpechoat $n You hit the target dead center!
    mpmadd $n quest 0 3 1
  endif
endif
~
|
#13502
centaurgrove~
a centaur~
A centaur is here.~
She stands around seven feet tall and is powerfully muscled.  Her equine
lower section merges smoothly with her human torso making this mixed breed
seem very natural.  You are a little distracted by the fact that she wears
no clothes.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
30 0 BODY_FOOT 1d1+479 1d1+21
50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
#13503
centaurgrove blacksmith~
a centaur blacksmith~
A centaur glances toward you.~
He stands over eight feet tall and is powerfully muscled.  His equine lower
section merges smoothly with his human torso making this mixed breed
seem very natural.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
25 0 BODY_FOOT 1d1+1000 1d1+30
50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#13504
centaurgrove leader~
a centaur leader~
A centaur stands here proudly.~
He stands over nine feet tall and is powerfully muscled.  His equine lower
section merges smoothly with his human torso making this mixed breed
seem very natural.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
50 0 BODY_FOOT 10d10+1000 10d1+30
50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 9
  if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
    say Welcome to our headquarters, $n
    say We always need new recruits.  Would you care to join?
  else
    if quest(0, 3, $n) == 5
      say Great job $n!  Welcome to the Centaur Army!
      mpechoat $n To officially join you must type the following:
      mpechoat $n army join [password]
      say Come tell me anytime you feel you deserve a
      say promotion, and I will see what I can do.
      mpmset $n long Private $n of the Centaur Cavalry is here.
      mpmset $n quest 0 3 6
    else
      if quest(0, 3, $n) == 6
        say Report Soldier!
        say Do you wish to retire or think you deserve
        say a promotion?
      else
        if quest(0, 3, $n) == 7
          say How does it feel to be put out to pasture?
        else
          say Keep practicing!  You will get it right!
      endif
    endif
  endif
else
  if race($n) == 10
    shout The despicable Gith have entered the Grove!
    mpkill $n
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog promotion rank~
if race($n) == 9
 if quest(0, 3, $n) == 6
  if level($n) > 89
    say You have achieved the rank of General.
    say Congratulations!
    mpmset $n long General $n of the Centaur Cavalry is here.
  else
    if level($n) > 69
      say You have achieved the rank of Major.
      say Congratulations!
      mpmset $n long Major $n of the Centaur Cavalry is here.
    else
      if level($n) > 49
        say You have achieved the rank of Captain.
        say Congratulations!
        mpmset $n long Captain $n of the Centaur Cavalry is here.
      else
        if level($n) > 29
          say You have achieved the rank of Sergeant.
          say Congratulations!
          mpmset $n long Sergeant $n of the Centaur Cavalry is here.
        else
          say You are still only a Private.
          say Keep trying, one day you'll get there!
          mpmset $n long Private $n of the Centaur Cavalry is here.
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
 endif
endif
~
>speech_prog retire resign~
say Of course you may retire, Oldtimer.
mpechoat $n Type the following: army retire [password]
mpmset $n long (Oldtimer) $n is out to pasture.
mpmset $n quest 0 3 7
~
>speech_prog yes yeah ok yep sure~
if race($n) == 9
  if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
    say Excellent!  Now before you are allowed to join
    say you must complete a simple training exercise.
    say Go to the Archery range and prove your skill
    say by hitting dead center at least four targets.
    rescale 13501 $n 100
    mpmset $n quest 0 3 1
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog archery practice reset range~
say The targets have been set up for you at the range.
rescale 13501 $n 100
~
|
#13505
centaurgrove healer~
a centaur healer~
A centaur inquires after your health.~
She stands around seven feet tall and is powerfully muscled.  Her equine
lower section merges smoothly with her human torso making this mixed breed
seem very natural.  You are a little distracted by the fact that she wears
no clothes.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_SANCTUARY 0 S
50 0 BODY_FOOT 10d10+1000 10d1+30
50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>rand_prog 100~
if rand(15)
  cast sanctuary $n
else
  if rand(15)
    cast bless $n
  else
    if rand(15)
      cast 'giant strength' $n
    else
      if rand(15)
        cast shield $n
      else
        if rand(15)
          cast armor $n
        else
          cast 'cure critical' $n
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
|
