50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
#13507
centaurgrove sentinel~
a centaur sentinel~
A centaur sentinel stands here proudly.~
He stands over nine feet tall and is powerfully muscled.  His equine lower
section merges smoothly with his human torso making this mixed breed
seem very natural.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
95 0 BODY_FOOT 1d1+8000 1d1+80
50000 RACE_CENTAUR
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 9
  if sex($n) == 1
    say Greetings Brother.
  else
    say Greetings Sister.
  endif
else
  if race($n) == 10
    shout The despicable Gith have entered the Grove!
    rescale 13507 $n 160
    mpkill $n
  else
    say Outsiders may not enter the grove.
    mptransfer $n 15200
  endif
endif
~    
